# Normalise line endings: LF in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf on Windows rewrites files to CRLF on checkout and
# Git warns on every add. Worse for contributors: each platform produces a
# different ending, so pull requests carry diffs that are nothing but line
# endings. Pinning eol=lf keeps every checkout identical.
#
# The shell hooks in .husky/ and the bin/vnstock shebang also need LF to run.
* text=auto eol=lf
